ister it, or to have management software that involves <strong>SAP training Canada<\/strong> for its implementation and subsequent management.<\/p><p>Problems such as lack of control over inventory, not following up on accounts receivable processes, mixing of the entrepreneur&#8217;s personal expenses with those of the business, not having control over billing are just some that, however small they may seem, begin to accumulate and create capital outflows, which can put business profits and finances at risk.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1d89ee91\" data-id=\"1d89ee91\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3516c46d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3516c46d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"568\" height=\"425\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-bad-administration.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1260\" alt=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/14UuPJzOCXoSuHzQGvJffgQczemPIKvGBTubTsdUe2Es\/edit\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-bad-administration.jpg 568w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-bad-administration-300x224.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 568px) 100vw, 568px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5f0a4ad4 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5f0a4ad4\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-17a0f840\" data-id=\"17a0f840\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69c0ff78 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"69c0ff78\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"571\" height=\"304\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-lack-of-financial-planning.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1264\" alt=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/14UuPJzOCXoSuHzQGvJffgQczemPIKvGBTubTsdUe2Es\/edit\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-lack-of-financial-planning.jpg 571w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-lack-of-financial-planning-300x160.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 571px) 100vw, 571px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2ea0fdf7\" data-id=\"2ea0fdf7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57396969 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"57396969\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>Lack of financial planning? Solve it with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/sap-training-canada\/\">Sap training Canada<\/a><\/strong><\/h3><p>In addition to mismanagement, not having adequate planning for fixed business expenses, investments in raw materials or merchandise, payment of salaries, among others, is a mistake that entrepreneurs often make, which leads them to get into debt requesting loans or loans, stop paying your staff and enter a dead end, which could be avoided by having financial planning, budget analysis, short, medium and long-term projections, as well as alerts to detect an imminent crisis and act accordingly. time to get out of it successfully.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-00b5306 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"00b5306\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-58dab99\" data-id=\"58dab99\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0673805 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0673805\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Not having market analysis<\/strong><br \/>The owner of a small business probably thinks that market analysis is unnecessary, but it is one of the reasons why a brilliant idea may not turn into a successful business, since the entrepreneur can launch into the market with a proposal that does not meet to the needs of your potential customers by choosing the wrong segment.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e7c7e85\" data-id=\"e7c7e85\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-71f1d45 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"71f1d45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"566\" height=\"231\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-not-having-market-analysis.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1267\" alt=\"Why do companies fail?\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-not-having-market-analysis.jpg 566w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/why-do-companies-fail-not-having-market-analysis-300x122.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 566px) 100vw, 566px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-56bc089 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"56bc089\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ee8ef34\" data-id=\"ee8ef34\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-eleme